hi I'm Talulah Riley and I'm really  excited to be releasing my debut novel  act of love acts of love is a modern-day  love story it's about a woman called  Bernadette who is a journalist and has  made her career out of profiling  successful men and then divulging their  secrets and she lures them into a false  sense of security and then it's quite  mean about them but at some point she  meets Bradley Blake who she is sent to  interview and he challenges all of the  assumptions that she's had about the  male gender the inspiration for writing  the book was because I started thinking  about male romantic characters in  literature you know from mr. Rochester  to Christian Grey and how a lot of those  characters tended to have quite  misogynistic tendencies and I wondered  if he could have a female protagonist  who was equally as bad in ways usually  leveled at women so sexually  manipulative conniving you know just out  out Fernand and I wondered whether that  would still be considered an attractive  character by people my biggest literary  inspiration for acts of love was gone  with the wind because of the character  of Scarlett O'Hara who was the original  female badass so I wanted to write a  modern-day Scarlett I have always wanted  to be a writer I've written my whole  life journaling poetry prose screenplays  and it's really exciting to be having a  published novel because it's a child  country  you
 

